{{- /* The shellx master key.

     The helper no longer embeds the key. It reads this file instead. The
     key is `sha256sum("com.ardju.utils:shellx:<nonce>")`, where the nonce
     is `.system_environment.nonce` from `.chezmoi.yaml.tmpl`. The
     `com.ardju.utils:<tool>:` reverse-DNS namespace is per-tool, so each
     tool that derives from the shared nonce picks its own namespace string
     and the hash domains stay disjoint.

     The `private_` attribute gives the target mode 0600. `shellx key move`
     copies this key into the platform secret store and removes this file,
     so a file scanner never sees the key. */ -}}
{{- printf "%s%s" "com.ardju.utils:shellx:" .system_environment.nonce | sha256sum -}}
